# Supabase agent skills: `npx skills add supabase/agent-skills` writes the real files to
# .agents/skills/ (committed) and symlinks them into .claude/skills/ with an absolute
# machine-local path, which breaks on any other clone. Ignore the symlinks, keep the source.
.claude/skills/supabase
.claude/skills/supabase-postgres-best-practices
